SUMMARY:The Spokes Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:The Spokes Live @ The Melon Ball in Davis \nReturning for its second year\, come join The Spokes for an exciting evening of cabaret-style performances! Full of fun arrangements and new members\, but with the same beautiful sound! The Spokes have been the premier all high voice a cappella group at UC Davis since 2004! \nTheir fiery\, fabulous\, and feminine style brings joy to audiences all over the West Coast\, most notably in their annual spring a cappella showcase\, HellaCappella. Not only exciting crowds with their captivating energy\, The Spokes have excelled in their craft\, placing second at ICCA Quarterfinals in 2024 and taking home Best Soloist in 2021. \nThe Spokes take pride in cultivating an uplifting bond of high voice singers and are dedicated to empowering their community. Just as a bicycle wheel relies on the support of all its spokes\, all the Spokes depend on one another to be the fabulous group they are! \nFind ways to engage with The Spokes HERE! \nGeneral Admission $20\nStudent Tickets $15 (in-store or at the door only\, with student ID)\nDoors open at 7:00pm \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card) \nThis is a BYOB event!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/the-spokes-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/SpokesNEWNEW-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
