SUMMARY:Park Winters Holiday Farm Dinner Concert
DESCRIPTION:ZG Smith pairs poignant\, ethereal songwriting with a rich Americana sound. A seasoned touring artist\, he has performed across the U.S.\, Canada and Europe and shared the stage with acts including The Chicks\, Trombone Shorty and Collective Soul. \nYour experience will include cocktail hour starting at 4:30\, followed by a multi-course Farm Dinner at 6 – Music starts at 7:30.\n*tickets are non-refundable \nShow Less
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/park-winters-holiday-farm-dinner-concert/
