SUMMARY:Sipping with Sylvia and Chef Wong for the holidays
DESCRIPTION:The most common asked question this time of year is\, “What wines pair with my holiday meals?” This class\, hosted at Turkovich Family Wines\, is designed to help answer that question. We will pair an appetizer\, a turkey dish and a dessert with appropriate wines. Space is limited\, reservations are required. Tickets are $35 per person.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/sipping-with-sylvia-and-chef-wong-for-the-holidays/
LOCATION:Turkovich Family Wines Tasting Room\, 304 Railroad Ave\, CA\, United States
